{"id":"2f10383b8be6f0dd","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-modulus.md","title":"稳定模引理","display":"thm-modulus — 稳定模引理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-modulus","aliases":["20-thm-modulus"],"display":"thm-modulus — 稳定模引理","chapter":"3","section":"3.5","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Proposition 3.5.5","source_pdf_pages":[102],"source_printed_pages":[66],"depends_on":["[[20-df-computable-approximation]]","[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","[[20-df-domination]]","[[20-df-pairing]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-modulus"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-modulus</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-modulus — 稳定模引理"},{"key":"chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"section","html":"3.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Proposition 3.5.5"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>102</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>66</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ea4f6c0d21b23194\" href=\"?note=ea4f6c0d21b23194\" title=\"20-df-computable-approximation\">20-df-computable-approximation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2e0726b34b0b1c40\" href=\"?note=2e0726b34b0b1c40\" title=\"20-df-domination\">20-df-domination</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\">\\(g\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\rightsquigarrow f\">\\(g\\rightsquigarrow f\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:\\omega\\to\\omega\">\\(h:\\omega\\to\\omega\\)</span> 全定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m_g\\le^*h\">\\(m_g\\le^*h\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_h=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle:h(x)=y\\}\">\\(H_h=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle:h(x)=y\\}\\)</span> 是通过配对编码得到的数集合。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ea4f6c0d21b23194\" href=\"?note=ea4f6c0d21b23194\" title=\"20-df-computable-approximation\">20-df-computable-approximation</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2e0726b34b0b1c40\" href=\"?note=2e0726b34b0b1c40\" title=\"20-df-domination\">20-df-domination</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}modulus}\\vdash\nf\\in\\mathcal C_1^{H_h}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}modulus}\\vdash\nf\\in\\mathcal C_1^{H_h}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>除有限多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 外，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(x,h(x))=f(x)\">\\(g(x,h(x))=f(x)\\)</span>。把有限例外及其正确值写入程序。给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_h\">\\(H_h\\)</span> oracle，搜索首个使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in H_h\">\\(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in H_h\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> 全定义而停止，随后计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(x,y)\">\\(g(x,y)\\)</span>。函数的图作为数集合明确编码，最终支配采用上游的一般全函数签名。</p>\n<p>来源：Proposition 3.5.5；印刷页 66；PDF 第 102 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-computable-approximation","status":"resolved","id":"ea4f6c0d21b23194","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable-approximation]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-domination","status":"resolved","id":"2e0726b34b0b1c40","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-domination]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable-approximation","status":"resolved","id":"ea4f6c0d21b23194","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-approximation]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-df-domination]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-approximation]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-df-domination]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-domination","status":"resolved","id":"2e0726b34b0b1c40","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-approximation]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-df-domination]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-approximation]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-df-domination]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"g\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}","display":false},{"tex":"g\\rightsquigarrow f","display":false},{"tex":"h:\\omega\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"m_g\\le^*h","display":false},{"tex":"H_h=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle:h(x)=y\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}modulus}\\vdash\nf\\in\\mathcal C_1^{H_h}.","display":true},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"g(x,h(x))=f(x)","display":false},{"tex":"H_h","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in H_h","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"g(x,y)","display":false}],"bytes":1398,"backlinks":[{"id":"15cf85fd84eaf3f9","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"编码与模型：[[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]、[[20-df-oracle-machine]]、[[20-df-prefix-free-machine]]、[[20-df-lachlan-game]]、[[20-thm-modulus]]。"}],"outgoing":["ea4f6c0d21b23194","140cce30ee9c16d1","2e0726b34b0b1c40","35073b74f84433b3"]}